# Saheeli's Lattice // Mastercraft Raptor. As the Lattice enters Bot1 discards Giant Cindermaw and draws two. "Craft with one
# or more Dinosaurs {4}{R}" (CR 702.167a-b): Dinosaurs Bot1 controls and Dinosaur cards in its graveyard - the Ornithopter,
# a creature but no Dinosaur, may not be chosen (refused); Rampaging Ferocidon on the battlefield and the Cindermaw in the
# graveyard, two of them, are. Mastercraft Raptor's power is the total power of the exiled cards used to craft it (CR
# 702.167c, 604.3): 3 and 4, 7, its toughness the printed 4.

